#: ../../source/functions/github/stars.md:1
msgid "Stars"
msgstr "星"

#: ../../source/functions/github/stars.md:3
msgid "The stars feature displays stars of a specific repository."
msgstr "スター機能は、特定のリポジトリのスターを表示します。"

#: ../../source/functions/github/stars.md:5
msgid "![1744983551066](image/stars/1744983551066.png)"
msgstr "![1744983551066](image/stars/1744983551066.png)"

#: ../../source/functions/github/stars.md:5
msgid "1744983551066"
msgstr "1744983551066"

#: ../../source/functions/github/stars.md:7
msgid "In the FlexDesigner"
msgstr "FlexDesigner で"

#: ../../source/functions/github/stars.md:9
msgid "The FlexDesigner exposes the following settings in the key tab:"
msgstr "FlexDesigner では、キー タブに次の設定が表示されます。"

#: ../../source/functions/github/stars.md:11
msgid ""
"Format: Set the format of the string. The text '`<STARS>`' would be replaced"
" by the number of stars. If '`<STARS>`' is not present in the format string,"
" it would be appended to the end of the string."
msgstr ""
"形式: 文字列の形式を設定します。テキスト「<STARS>」は星の数に置き換えられます。 '<STARS>`' "
"がフォーマット文字列に存在しない場合は、文字列の末尾に追加されます。"

#: ../../source/functions/github/stars.md:12
msgid "Owner/ Repository: Set the source repository to display the data for."
msgstr "所有者/リポジトリ: データを表示するソース リポジトリを設定します。"

#: ../../source/functions/github/stars.md:14
msgid ""
"Additionally, you can click on the star icon to manually refresh the data."
msgstr "さらに、星のアイコンをクリックしてデータを手動で更新することもできます。"

#: ../../source/functions/github/stars.md:16
msgid "![1744983726528](image/stars/1744983726528.png)"
msgstr "![1744983726528](image/stars/1744983726528.png)"

#: ../../source/functions/github/stars.md:16
msgid "1744983726528"
msgstr "1744983726528"

#: ../../source/functions/github/stars.md:18
msgid "On the Flexbar"
msgstr "Flexbar 上で"

#: ../../source/functions/github/stars.md:20
msgid ""
"The star count would be displayed in the area allocated for this feature. "
"This is no interactive actions for this key."
msgstr "星の数は、この機能に割り当てられた領域に表示されます。このキーに対する対話型アクションはありません。"

